            "authorAssociation": "MEMBER",
            "body": "There is [this comment](https://github.com/echasnovski/mini.nvim/blob/a84b7e555fe382c1859e6ca46b4983c822a1f77f/doc/mini-completion.txt#L147-L150) specifically for this use case. Maybe also use `return MiniPairs.cr()` instead of `return require('mini.pairs').cr()`, but that is more of a style preference in this case.",
            "bodyHTML": "<p dir=\"auto\">There is <a href=\"https://github.com/echasnovski/mini.nvim/blob/a84b7e555fe382c1859e6ca46b4983c822a1f77f/doc/mini-completion.txt#L147-L150\">this comment</a> specifically for this use case. Maybe also use <code class=\"notranslate\">return MiniPairs.cr()</code> instead of <code class=\"notranslate\">return require('mini.pairs').cr()</code>, but that is more of a style preference in this case.</p>",
            "bodyText": "There is this comment specifically for this use case. Maybe also use return MiniPairs.cr() instead of return require('mini.pairs').cr(), but that is more of a style preference in this case.",
