                    "authorAssociation": "NONE",
                    "body": "Ok. I have found where the problem come from. I was doing my remap inside the now function of mini.deps and was calling the setup function of mini.pairs in later. So my remap was overwritten by mini.pairs remap of `<cr>`.",
                    "bodyHTML": "<p dir=\"auto\">Ok. I have found where the problem come from. I was doing my remap inside the now function of mini.deps and was calling the setup function of mini.pairs in later. So my remap was overwritten by mini.pairs remap of <code class=\"notranslate\">&lt;cr&gt;</code>.</p>",
                    "bodyText": "Ok. I have found where the problem come from. I was doing my remap inside the now function of mini.deps and was calling the setup function of mini.pairs in later. So my remap was overwritten by mini.pairs remap of <cr>.",
