                    "replyTo": {
                        "databaseId": 12246994,
                        "id": "DC_kwDOFoksYM4Aut_S",
                        "url": "https://github.com/nvim-mini/mini.nvim/discussions/1585#discussioncomment-12246994"
                    },
                    "resourcePath": "/nvim-mini/mini.nvim/discussions/1585#discussioncomment-12247402",
                    "updatedAt": "2025-02-19T09:07:47Z",
                    "upvoteCount": 0,
                    "url": "https://github.com/nvim-mini/mini.nvim/discussions/1585#discussioncomment-12247402"
                },
                {
                    "author": {
                        "avatarUrl": "https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/24854248?u=d09fd974c6720eba3039db6beb2f1c1efecdb51d&v=4",
                        "login": "echasnovski",
                        "resourcePath": "/echasnovski",
                        "url": "https://github.com/echasnovski"
                    },
                    "authorAssociation": "MEMBER",
                    "body": "> Ok. I have found where the problem come from. I was doing my remap inside the now function of mini.deps and was calling the setup function of mini.pairs in later. So my remap was overwritten by mini.pairs remap of `<cr>`.\r\n\r\nJust a follow up: on latest `main` 'mini.pairs' now won't override custom `<BS>` and `<CR>` mappings. Thanks for bringing attention to this!",
                    "bodyHTML": "<blockquote>\n<p dir=\"auto\">Ok. I have found where the problem come from. I was doing my remap inside the now function of mini.deps and was calling the setup function of mini.pairs in later. So my remap was overwritten by mini.pairs remap of <code class=\"notranslate\">&lt;cr&gt;</code>.</p>\n</blockquote>\n<p dir=\"auto\">Just a follow up: on latest <code class=\"notranslate\">main</code> 'mini.pairs' now won't override custom <code class=\"notranslate\">&lt;BS&gt;</code> and <code class=\"notranslate\">&lt;CR&gt;</code> mappings. Thanks for bringing attention to this!</p>",
                    "bodyText": "Ok. I have found where the problem come from. I was doing my remap inside the now function of mini.deps and was calling the setup function of mini.pairs in later. So my remap was overwritten by mini.pairs remap of <cr>.\n\nJust a follow up: on latest main 'mini.pairs' now won't override custom <BS> and <CR> mappings. Thanks for bringing attention to this!",
